# Nous Portal's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-nous-setting-token = Nous Portal OAuth 访问令牌，用于替代 ~/.hermes/auth.json 中 Hermes Agent 的登录信息（使用 `hermes auth add nous` 登录）。令牌有效期约一小时；不接受门户 API 密钥。
usage-nous-setting-base-url = 用于预览部署的 HTTPS 门户源地址，例如 https://portal.nousresearch.com。不接受明文 HTTP。

## The report: the subscription's monthly credits, top-up credits, and when
## the subscription renews. Plan and organization names, and the renewal
## date (such as Oct 12), stay as figures.

usage-nous-subscription-credits = 订阅积分
usage-nous-monthly-grant = 每月发放
usage-nous-top-up-credits = 充值积分
usage-nous-total-usable = 可用总额
usage-nous-organization = 组织
usage-nous-rollover-credits = 结转积分
usage-nous-renews = 续订时间
# A section's title, and the plan line of an active subscription that names
# no plan.
usage-nous-subscription = 订阅
